flowchart TB
    A[Flutter Android client] --> API[Authenticated application API]
    W[Flutter web client] --> API
    D[Physical client display and rotary input] --> DG[Device gateway: pairing, protocol, action deduplication]
    DG --> CORE[Overview, reminder scheduler and focus services]
    API --> CORE
    CORE --> DB[(Relational database)]
    SYNC[Background synchronization worker] --> C[Calendar adapter]
    SYNC --> N[Notion adapter]
    SYNC --> DB
    CORE --> B[Grounded briefing service]
    B --> LM[Replaceable model adapter]
    B --> F[Deterministic fallback]
